Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.32,0:16:54.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nanti mampus benaran, lo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.66,0:16:56.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Chisa, kasih tahu dia.
