Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.79,0:17:03.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku harus menghentikan mereka!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.46,0:17:07.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sabar, Menor, ikuti saja dulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.22,0:17:08.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biar apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.17,0:17:11.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita bikin dia mabuk\Ndan cerita segalanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.39,0:17:14.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, sih.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.18,0:17:16.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Awas kalau jadi masalah baru!
