Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.61,0:18:09.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biarkan saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.49,0:18:12.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah, sampai jumpa!
