Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.87,0:18:17.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kitahara bilang,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.11,0:18:18.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Aku ingat!\N- "Aku ingat!"
