Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.50,0:18:27.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soalnya ekspresinya sangat serius.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.50,0:18:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Astaga, si Bodoh itu!
