Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.65,0:18:51.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, gajinya ludes buat memesan\Npenerbangan malam.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.65,0:18:53.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia transit dulu ke Guam.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.52,0:18:56.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pasti mahal, tuh.
