Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.79,0:21:11.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sama-sama sulit terus terang.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.46,0:21:27.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ibu...
